  "description": "Design and installation of interior cargo handling systems: reinforced floor rails with attachment points, roller conveyors for pallet/container transfer, powered cargo winches and drive systems, and the 88x125 inch pallet and LD3/LD7 container interface standards that enable intermodal loading. Covers floor load distribution, lashing net design, and weight-and-balance envelopes for shifting loads.",
